        ":question/problem": "Let $L=MN.$ What is the value of ${l}_{22}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>\n\n${l}_{22}=$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $2$nd row in $M$ by the $2$nd column in $N$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{l}_{22} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =4\\cdot 2+2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =8+6 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
