        ":question/problem": "Let $P=QR.$ What is the value of ${p}_{31}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>\n\n${p}_{31}=$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $3$rd row in $Q$ by the $1$st column in $R$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{p}_{31} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =2(5)+1(-3)+(-2)(1) \\\\  & =10-3-2 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
