        ":question/problem": "Let $X=YZ.$ What is the value of ${x}_{12}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>\n\n${x}_{12}=$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $Y$ by the $2$nd column in $Z$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{12} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-2)(5)+3(-3)+0(1) \\\\  & =-10-9+0 \\\\  & =-19.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
