        ":question/problem": "Let $Z=XY.$ What is the value of ${z}_{24}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 5 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>\n\n${z}_{24}=$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nZ=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 5 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $2$nd row in $X$ by the $4$th column in $Y,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}_{24} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =3(-3)+2(2) \\\\  & =-9+4 \\\\  & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
