        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-70946",
        ":question/problem": "Let $D=EF.$ What is the value of ${d}_{23}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$F=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & -5 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & -5 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $2$nd row in $E$ by the $3$rd column in $F$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{d}_{23} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-4)\\cdot (-5)+3\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =20-6 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
