        ":question/problem": "Let $K=MN.$ What is the value of ${k}_{12}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -4 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nK=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -4 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $M$ by the $2$nd column in $N$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{k}_{12} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =5\\cdot (-1)+(-4)\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =-5+8 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
