        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-70956",
        ":question/problem": "Let $T=UV.$ What is the value of ${t}_{41}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 10 \\\\ -3 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 3 & 10\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$V=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 10 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 20 & -1\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 10 \\\\ -3 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 3 & 10\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 10 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 20 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $4$th row of $U$ by the $1$st column in $V$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}_{41} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 3 & 10\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-5)\\cdot (-2)+3\\cdot (-1)+10\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =10-3-10 \\\\  & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
