        ":question/id": "01084ebc-a27f-547f-baec-04fae1ac84bf",
        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-70958",
        ":question/problem": "Let $R=PQ.$ What is the value of ${r}_{25}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -6 \\\\ 1 & -8 \\\\ 3 & -9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 2 & -1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -6 \\\\ 1 & -8 \\\\ 3 & -9\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 2 & -1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $2$nd row of $P$ by the $5$th column of $Q$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{25} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =3\\cdot 10+(-4)\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =30-28 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      }
    ],
